# --- Deployment only — leave these UNSET locally ---------------------------
# The collection service on Railway mounts a volume and points the research DB at it.
# Commented out deliberately: an empty value is treated as unset by the code, but
# leaving them commented keeps local runs obviously using the repo-relative defaults.
# RESEARCH_DB_PATH=/data/research.db
#
# BETS_DB_PATH is intentionally NEVER set in a deployed environment. The collection
# service only writes research.db; the real-money record stays on the local machine.
